// Local development convenience only.
//
// Every CI job MUST run with GOWORK=off. A workspace silently satisfies
// imports that are missing from a module's go.mod, so a green build here says
// nothing about whether `go get` works for a consumer.
//
// While migrating keystone's matter adapter onto this protocol it is useful to
// add `../keystone` to the `use` block locally. Do not commit that line.
go 1.23

use (
	./core
	./sidecar
)
